{
  "mode": "chapter",
  "errors": [],
  "readings": [
    {
      "hash": "#chapter-8",
      "images": 45,
      "broken": [],
      "overflow": false,
      "balloons": [
        {
          "panel": "N8-01",
          "text": "Next morning. Tenth round complete.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-01",
          "text": "They will still be there when you have put your money away.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-02",
          "text": "I have the request. I still do not know the door.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-02",
          "text": "SeraThen we look before we promise.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-05",
          "text": "Stay on the dry side, please.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-06",
          "text": "You asked about first-bell collection. This is Aren, and Sera came to see the approach.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-06",
          "text": "EddaFirst bell is when this doorway is clear.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-07",
          "text": "Second bell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-07",
          "text": "The tubs keep moving through second bell. I cannot stop the wash floor for a cart.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-08",
          "text": "First bell is my Lower Post round. I cannot take that time.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-09",
          "text": "Then why did you come?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-09",
          "text": "ArenBecause we had not looked at the door.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-09",
          "text": "EddaGood. Look before you quote me.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-10",
          "text": "These are ours. Two small bundles, dry and tied. We can try with them.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-11",
          "text": "DaroThe wheel stays out. That sill has a job.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-12",
          "text": "I can carry one through by hand.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-12",
          "text": "SeraWe should see whether the doorway stays clear while you do.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-13",
          "text": "One out-and-back trial, as far as the trough. Both bundles come back to this bench.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-13",
          "text": "EddaI will pay each of you for the trial, even if we stop at the door.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-14",
          "text": "DaroI can do one trial now. The packing yard has me after third bell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-14",
          "text": "ArenIf the route does not work, we bring it back.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-15",
          "text": "Use the morning as it is. Do not clear it for us.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-18",
          "text": "Wait. I am taking your doorway.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-20",
          "text": "That is what I meant by first bell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-20",
          "text": "ArenYou needed the doorway back. Not an earlier cart.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-21",
          "text": "Does that one open onto the dry bench?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-22",
          "text": "We use it for mending. A collection basket will not fit.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-22",
          "text": "DaroThese wraps will. The cart stays out here.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-23",
          "text": "If the wash floor keeps moving, I do not need you at first bell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-27",
          "text": "Beside the first. Keep the handle side clear.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-30",
          "text": "Enough room to stop and let someone past.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-32",
          "text": "Dry. Both back. And the floor never stopped.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-33",
          "text": "Use this hatch when we agree a collection. Do not leave a stack outside for me to find.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-34",
          "text": "After the post, between second and third bell. Only small, dry bundles like these.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-34",
          "text": "EddaAnd I hand them over. Nothing waiting in the street.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-35",
          "text": "DaroAsk where the load is going before you put my cart in the plan.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-35",
          "text": "ArenDoor, load and your hours. Then a price.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-36",
          "text": "Dry hatch. Two bundles. One forecourt trial.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-36",
          "text": "SeraThat is what we have seen.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-37",
          "text": "For your time. The stopped attempt counted too.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-38",
          "text": "And yours.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-39",
          "text": "Next time, knock here before you bring anything.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-39",
          "text": "ArenWe will ask about the load first.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-40",
          "text": "I nearly said first bell just to keep her listening.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-40",
          "text": "DaroShe listened when you stopped guessing about her morning.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-41",
          "text": "I have my next job. Ask me before you accept the next load.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-41",
          "text": "ArenI will.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-42",
          "text": "You stopped the first method before it stopped her work.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-42",
          "text": "ArenI still want to take the route assessment I missed.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-43",
          "text": "SeraAsk for the hours and the load. I can say what I saw; the assessor decides what is tested.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-43",
          "text": "ArenTomorrow after the post. I ask before I commit.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-45",
          "text": "I want to know which part I am ready for.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N8-45",
          "text": "SeraThen that is the question we take.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "snapshot_sha256": "92a897878d554d112ca9cb597cf25330f13f793ef0ca8851a7ff0b488b3fd1e4"
}
